<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>clairo 2</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">lilbubblegum</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">bubbleworld</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">7GDtFCmUL9NSE5RFPCXYjx</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">{"c":[{"tx":"作词: "},{"tx":"lilbubblegum"}]}</p><p ttm:agent="v1">{"c":[{"tx":"作曲: "},{"tx":"lilbubblegum"}]}</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Intro]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Like, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ayy, ooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, yeah, yeah, ayy, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">My neck be so runny (My neck be so runny)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I been gettin' money</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You can see me up, all this [?] bugs bunny</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And I don't wanna talk to these thots, that's on God</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Shawty, she a ten, and I know she ain't no thot</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I just wanted guap though</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I can't ever stop, no</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She be on my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But she swervin' me like potholes</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And, baby, don't you leave 'cause you live into my eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I just call her, "Clairo" 'cause forever she'll be mine, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Likе, I been gettin' bean like Kobе, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Up at the top like a podium, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I said, "I wanted the bag"</p><p ttm:agent="v1">"Not the music, but I really enjoy it, yeah"</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Nothing will come between that</p><p ttm:agent="v1">My motivation is to get all the cash, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You know I do this for the fam</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I feel like Jades 'cause I can't relax, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Bridge]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Hold up, hold up, wait, wait, wait, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Gettin' the bag, you know I'm just chasin' the cake, cake, cake</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Hol' up, I cannot cap</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Spent a rack on my waist, waist, waist (Waist)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And she gon' throw it back</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I don't know what to say, say, say, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Hold up, hold up, wait, wait, wait, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Gettin' the bag, you know I'm just chasin' the cake, cake, cake</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Hol' up, I cannot cap</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Spent a rack on my waist, waist, waist (Waist)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And she gon' throw it back</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I don't know what to say, say, say, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">My neck be so runny (My neck be so runny)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I been gettin' money</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You can see me up, all this [?] bugs bunny</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And I don't wanna talk to these thots, that's on God</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Shawty, she a ten, and I know she ain't no thot</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I just wanted guap though</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I can't ever stop, no</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She be on my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But she swervin' me like potholes</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And, baby, don't you leave 'cause you live into my eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I just call her, "Clairo" 'cause forever she'll be mine, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Outro]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Hold up, hold up, wait, wait, wait, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Gettin' the bag, you know I'm just chasin' the cake, cake, cake</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Hol' up, I cannot cap</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Spent a rack on my waist, waist, waist (Waist)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And she gon' throw it back</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I don't know what to say, say, say, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Hold up, hold up, wait, wait, wait, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Gettin' the bag, you know I'm just chasin' the cake, cake, cake</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Hol' up, I cannot cap</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Spent a rack on my waist, waist, waist (Waist)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And she gon' throw it back</p></div></body></tt>